 class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fde932e35a45d307\" href=\"?note=fde932e35a45d307\" title=\"67-df-independent-formula\">67-df-independent-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eb6e41357970ae6c\" href=\"?note=eb6e41357970ae6c\" title=\"67-thm-independent-formula\">67-thm-independent-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"45"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"56"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述已与原书逐项核对；已读源证明，未独立形式化其全部算术化细节"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq Q\">\\(T\\supseteq Q\\)</span> 是一致原始递归公理呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 递归可枚举；沿用本册固定句法编号与标准证明算术化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Num}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Num}_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Indep}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Indep}_T\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9c200c8ec3685766\" href=\"?note=9c200c8ec3685766\" title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fde932e35a45d307\" href=\"?note=fde932e35a45d307\" title=\"67-df-independent-formula\">67-df-independent-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\coloneqq\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\coloneqq\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}\\)</span> 是指定代入变量为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的公式域；数词实例都对该变量代入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的固定编号为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>。每个出现的有效理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 绑定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 的呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_A\">\\(E_A\\)</span>；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\">\\(\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1\\}\\quad\n\\exists\\eta\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\n\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\eta,X)\\land\\mathrm{Indep}_T(\\eta,\\mathbb N\\setminus X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1\\}\\quad\n\\exists\\eta\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\n\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\eta,X)\\land\\mathrm{Indep}_T(\\eta,\\mathbb N\\setminus X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 3.3, p.45（PDF 56）。这同时实现“成员恰为可证数词实例”与“非成员实例的任意有限正反指定仍相容”，比单独的 numeration 或独立公式族强。</p>\n<p>源证明先取全独立公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>，将所有有限符号扩张的定理集合合并为与 Q 逐句相容的 r.e. 集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>；以 Lemma 3.2(a) 构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\">\\(\\xi\\)</span>，确保任何非成员上的有限正析取不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 中，最后令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta=\\xi\\lor\\mu\">\\(\\eta=\\xi\\lor\\mu\\)</span>。若非成员实例有非重言式可证组合，选择相应的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 符号赋值就违反该禁入性质。已读来源证明；Lemma 3.2 的全部编码及复杂度细节没有在本原子独立形式化，故保持禁止作为已核验证明依赖的标记。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-numeration","status":"resolved","id":"9c200c8ec3685766","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-numeration]]","