-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Num}_T$、$\\mathrm{Indep}_T$ 与 $\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1$ 分别见 [[67-df-numeration]]、[[67-df-independent-formula]]、[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本条的固定编号为 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的 $g=c_{L_A}$。每个出现的有效理论 $A$ 绑定 [[67-df-certified-proof]] 的呈示 $E_A$；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 $\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)$ 及 [[67-df-proof-representation]] 的 $\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-certified-proof","status":"resolved","id":"189f5355af0e487c","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本条的固定编号为 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的 $g=c_{L_A}$。每个出现的有效理论 $A$ 绑定 [[67-df-certified-proof]] 的呈示 $E_A$；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 $\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)$ 及 [[67-df-proof-representation]] 的 $\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-representation","status":"resolved","id":"3fa0d0f598b791bc","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本条的固定编号为 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的 $g=c_{L_A}$。每个出现的有效理论 $A$ 绑定 [[67-df-certified-proof]] 的呈示 $E_A$；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 $\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)$ 及 [[67-df-proof-representation]] 的 $\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq Q","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Num}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Indep}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\coloneqq\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"g=c_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"E_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1\\}\\quad\n\\exists\\eta\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\n\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\eta,X)\\land\\mathrm{Indep}_T(\\eta,\\mathbb N\\setminus X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta=\\xi\\lor\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false}],"bytes":2986,"backlinks":[{"id":"57d3217ac67bc5a6","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取 [[67-lem-hypersimple-interval-existence]] 的 $H$，用 [[67-thm-numeration-independent-complement]] 取相应复杂度的 $\\eta$。成员实例已在 $T$ 中可证；非成员实例的有限正反指定一致，所以 $Z_{\\eta,H}$ 不可冗余且与全实例集相对演绎等价。补集无限还排除相对有限公理化。固定句法模板的数词实例集 $E_\\eta$ 是递归集：若无自由 $x$，它是单元素集；否则逐个核对固定模板及各替换位置的同一数词即可判定。因此可应用Lemma4.5的递归公理集前提。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-numeration-independent-complement]]"}],"outgoing":["9c200c8ec3685766","fde932e35a45d307","851cd80e64893935","eb6e41357970ae6c","a329235da6144513","189f5355af0e487c","3fa0d0f598b791bc"]}